<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Forge -->
  <ProtossForge.label>锻炉</ProtossForge.label>
  <!-- EN: The Protoss forge is where phase-smiths work. It comes with a full set of tools, AI assistants, a matter printer, and an extensive built-in library of technological blueprints—most of them locked, of course.\n\nIn theory, this technology needs only energy to generate matter, yet the bill always lists an assortment of materials. The Executor offers only a perfunctory explanation: the so-called “Khalai tax.” -->
  <ProtossForge.description>星灵锻炉是相位技师们工作的地方，包含完整的工具，ai助手和物质打印机，内置了大量技术蓝图——当然，大部分被锁上了。\n\n这套技术理论上只需能量便能生成物质，账单上却始终列着各式材料。执行官对此只有一个敷衍的解释：所谓的“卡莱税”。</ProtossForge.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Pylon -->
  <Pylon.label>水晶塔</Pylon.label>
  <!-- EN: You must construct additional Pylon!\n\n Pylon power nearby divice based on their power consume. -->
  <Pylon.description>你需要建造更多的水晶塔。\n\n 水晶塔基于附近一定范围内电器的耗电量提供电力。</Pylon.description>
  
</LanguageData>
